    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτά-μηνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, παιδίον, βρέφος, τέκνον,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a seven months' child,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Septim.</u>
			</span></i>passim ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίκτειν τινὰ ἑπτάμηνον,
				τίκτειν ἑπτάμηνα</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνα</span>], <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.69
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				584a36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτάμηνος, ἡ,</span>
			<i>a space of seven months,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Placit.
				5.18.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).53
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>).</div>
